Create Or Replace View VWCXC_Vendedores_Comision
As Select T1.VenCve, T1.VenNom, T2.CatCve, T3.CatDes, T2.RcvLmi,
       T2.RcvLms, T2.RcvCfi, T2.RcvPad, T2.RcvVa1, T2.RcvPo1,
       T2.RcvMdc
  From CxcVen T1
Left Outer Join CxcRcv T2
    On (T1.VenCve = T2.VenCve)
Left Outer Join InvCat T3
    On (T2.CatCve = T3.CatCve)
